#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:817
#: d6b57e1e1e6e4ea78d59d9a47a1a4ccc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``handle_command`` starts a dedicated file-server thread: "
"``file_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread`` for ``/file`` and "
"``file_folder_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread`` for "
