#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:851
#: 82f418a15fbf4c009e188c0fe656a483
msgid "Port allocation API"
msgstr "連接埠分配API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:853
#: c041090f476c4f37a46fc7a3f49653cb
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The server allocation APIs allow you to allocate a new port for other "
"servers. There are two kinds of port allocation modes."
msgstr "伺服器分配 API 允許您為其他伺服器指派新連接埠。連接埠分配方式有兩種。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:857
#: 4fa11de65ebc4b51b83ea26802b43e3f
msgid ""
"To change the port allocation mode, you can set the "
"``is_hand_alloc_port`` argument on the server instance. When set to "
"``False``, the server instance will choose the automatic port allocation "
"mode, or set to ``True`` it will choose the manual allocation mode."
msgstr "若要變更連接埠分配模式，您可以在伺服器實例上設定“is_hand_alloc_port”參數。當設定為“False”時，伺服器實例將選擇自動連接埠分配模式，或設定為“True”時，伺服器實例將選擇手動分配模式。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:863
#: aaa3428304234c0f81e2f83ab0481f17
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend using the automatic port allocation mode, which is "
"the default mode of the server, because the automatic port allocation "
"mode is more simple and also more stable than the manual port allocation "
"mode. In this mode, when calling the allocation APIs, it will return "
"``0``."
msgstr "我們最推薦您使用自動連接埠分配模式，這是伺服器的預設模式，因為自動連接埠分配模式比手動連接埠分配模式更簡單，也更穩定。在此模式下，呼叫分配API時，將傳回``0``。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:870
#: f9fbfedba34e4c3386442a9425b52a44
msgid ""
"*Note: The `bind` function in standard lib `socket` of the python "
"executor, when input ``0`` to the port parameter, will automatically "
"assign an available port by operating system.*"
msgstr "*注意：python執行器的標準lib `socket`中的`bind`函數，當連接埠參數輸入``0`時，作業系統會自動分配一個可用的連接埠。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:875
#: 4a1a578af0b14571a4180ebfc88073d6
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The other port allocation mode is the manual port allocation mode, there "
"is a port allocation range for the server. Please avoid opening other "
"servers in the same host, because in the existing version, the port range"
" may conflict and may cause unexpected errors."
msgstr "另一種連接埠分配方式是手動連接埠分配方式，伺服器有一個連接埠分配範圍。請避免在同一台主機上開啟其他伺服器，因為在現有版本中，連接埠分配範圍會發生衝突，並可能導致一些意外錯誤。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:882
#: d9301928a8f643868d7cc5852f986e0b
msgid ""
"The range of the port allocation is configured in the server settings. "
"The minimum allocatable port is ``self.port-"
"self.port_add_step*self.port_range_num``, and the maximum allocatable "
"port is ``self.port+1+self.port_add_step*self.port_range_num``."
msgstr ""
"連接埠分配的範圍在伺服器設定中配置。最小可分配連接埠為“self.port-"
"self.port_add_step*self.port_range_num”，最大可指派連接埠為“self.port+1+self.port_add_step*self.port_range_num”。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:888
#: 17b2666361504a0d8f5e10eb5fc9056a
msgid ""
"*Note: The ``self.port`` is the ``port`` argument of the server class. "
"The ``self.port_add_step`` is the ``port_add_step`` argument. And the "
"``self.port_range_num`` is the ``port_range_num`` argument.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：「self.port」是伺服器類別的「port」參數。 “self.port_add_step” 是“port_add_step” 參數。"
" ``self.port_range_num`` 是``port_range_num`` 參數。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:894
#: fefbe2307beb49d083c05018a96a2f3f
msgid "There are some relevant methods that can be used:"
msgstr "有一些相關的方法可以使用："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:909
#: 60738ce1224042aa9b39f5e5feec0e95
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `palloc` method allows you to get a port. When using this function, "
"you don't need to worry about the port allocation mode, because an "
"allocation mode detector is already implemented in this method. "
"`file_palloc`/`file_pfree` operate on the additive direction of the "
"range, `spy_palloc`/`spy_pfree` on the subtractive one, and "
"`alloc_port`/`free_port` reserve and release the instance's range in the "
"persistent log (no-ops in automatic mode)."
msgstr "`palloc` 方法可讓您取得連接埠。使用此函數時，您無需擔心連接埠指派模式，因為此方法中已經實作了分配模式偵測器。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:919
#: 54ccf91661524b1487fb666243fb627a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `pfree` method allows you to free a port. Like the `palloc` method, "
"you don't need to worry about the port allocation mode when using this "
"method."
msgstr "`pfree` 方法允許您釋放一個端口，與 `palloc` 方法相同，使用該方法時不需要關心端口分配模式。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:923
#: f4a62c2b675845148f52b3437e9c151e
msgid ""
"And there are the main functions for you to call, and for more "
"information about the port allocation functions, see the :ref:`tcp-"
"server-port-allocation-api` section."
msgstr "還有主要的函數供您調用，有關連接埠分配函數的更多信息，請參閱 :ref:`tcp-server-port-allocation-api` 部分。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:927
#: 9aead9c3ede94037a42b4f83a45b3bb4
msgid ""
"This mode is useful when you need an individual port for the server or  "
"must reserve a controlled range of ports for client-file transfers by "
"manual port allocation, such as in a testing environment or when multiple"
" server processes share the same host."
msgstr "當您需要伺服器的單獨連接埠或必須透過手動連接埠指派為用戶端檔案傳輸保留受控連接埠範圍時（例如在測試環境中或多個伺服器進程共用相同主機時），此模式非常有用。"

